d","commentBy":{"_id":"68b208afcb3bc793fa34599d","username":"BurpTheHunter","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"68b208afcb3bc793fa34599d"},"text":"is it still required to join in a game?"},"edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-08-30T17:08:35.305Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"68b331e9cb3bc793fa587f7c","commentBy":{"_id":"689937ef7ad5aa4c47378d2d","username":"Gurt5102943","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2025-08-11T00:23:11.263Z","lastActive":"2025-09-26T16:00:27.530Z","status":"offline","id":"689937ef7ad5aa4c47378d2d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Hey guys! sadly both Zenith and Swift are down at the moment, so I can't do the final round of testing for the update, but I'll let y'all know what it's about and release it as soon as possible. \n- Complete UI overhaul; the gui looks and functions much better than it previously did, and is much more organized. It will also include the ability to hide and show with the press of a key (this is the final part im working on, the built in command for the lib im working with doesnt function)\n- Complete aimbot overhaul; customizable color, FOV, and speed, and the ability to disable it when necessary.\n- Small visual improvements; added an FOV slider for your cam.\n- Auto functions improvements; all automatic features now work much better and run much cleaner.\nPLEASE JOIN THE DISCORD, I NEED TESTERS","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-08-30T17:16:25.379Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"68b34fdf8f824dfe935937e4","commentBy":{"_id":"689937ef7ad5aa4c47378d2d","username":"Gurt5102943","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2025-08-11T00:23:11.263Z","lastActive":"2025-09-26T16:00:27.530Z","status":"offline","id":"689937ef7ad5aa4c47378d2d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Zenith back up - update released\nEnjoy!","parent":{"_id":"68b331e9cb3bc793fa587f7c","commentBy":{"_id":"689937ef7ad5aa4c47378d2d","username":"Gurt5102943","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"689937ef7ad5aa4c47378d2d"},"text":"Hey guys! sadly both Zenith and Swift are down at the moment, so I can't do the final round of testing for the update, but I'll let y'all know what it's about and release it as soon as possible. \n- Complete UI overhaul; the gui looks and functions much better than it previously did, and is much more organized. It will also include the ability to hide and show with the press of a key (this is the final part im working on, the built in command for the lib im working with doesnt function)\n- Complete aimbot overhaul; customizable color, FOV, and speed, and the ability to disable it when necessary.\n- Small visual improvements; added an FOV slider for your cam.\n- Auto functions improvements; all automatic features now work much better and run much cleaner.\nPLEASE JOIN THE DISCORD, I NEED TESTERS"},"edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-08-30T19:24:15.240Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"68b35c6010f454d7eef448ef","commentBy":{"_id":"6701deca2bd80ffef1655f20","username":"pllsp25","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2024-10-06T00:50:18.710Z","lastActive":"2026-03-05T23:35:19.729Z","status":"offline","id":"6701deca2bd80ffef1655f20","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"@Gurt5102943 Fire Script and Update!","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"cre